<title>HUNGARY: S.AFRICA REFORMED CHURCH RE-ADMITTED TO WORLD BODY.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA REFORMED CHURCH RE-ADMITTED TO WORLD BODY.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reformed Church has been readmitted to World Alliance of Reformed Churches (WARC), 15 years after it was expelled, Hungarian news agency MTI reported on Monday.</p>
<p>WARC delegates, meeting on Debrecen in south-eastern Hungary, voted unanimously to reverse a decision taken in 1982 to exclude the South African church for what was seen as its support for apartheid.</p>
</text>
